flowchart TB
  IN["I25: Approved production migration window"]:::source
  CONTROL["Required controls<br/>X11"]:::control
  S1["Review blockers, rollback point and<br/>communications<br/><b>OpenProject</b>"]:::process
  IN --> S1
  S2["Quiesce source writes and revoke old<br/>execution ownership<br/><b>systemd / provider credentials</b>"]:::process
  S1 --> S2
  S3["Capture final consistent delta and restore<br/>target<br/><b>Existing backup tools</b>"]:::process
  S2 --> S3
  S4["Change DNS, ingress and selected routes<br/>deliberately<br/><b>Ansible / OpenWrt / Caddy</b>"]:::process
  S3 --> S4
  S5["Validate canary actions and independent<br/>reachability<br/><b>Playwright / operator</b>"]:::process
  S4 --> S5
  GATE{"Single owner and canary acceptance<br/>confirmed?"}:::gate
  S5 --> GATE
  GATE -- "No / unknown" --> HOLD["HOLD<br/>Repair, review or reconcile"]:::hold
  CONTROL -. "enforced at action boundary" .-> GATE
  S6["Release one channel at a time with approvals<br/><b>Channel owners</b>"]:::process
  GATE -- "Yes" --> S6
  OUT["Controlled production ownership transfer and<br/>audit"]:::done
  S6 --> OUT
  NEXT["Connected handoffs<br/>I33, E05, V04, M17, I26"]:::ext
  OUT --> NEXT

